# QAFusionX — LOCKED FLOW (Constitution v2026-08-22)

When QAFusionX MCP is connected, this flow is **immutable**. Do not improvise, shorten, or skip.

## Rule zero

1. Call `qafusionx_status` every turn — show the numbered todo list.
2. If `askMode.unlocked` is false → **Cursor Ask mode** + Questions 1 & 2 only.
3. If any tool returns `BLOCKED` → finish the named step; write the tick in `step-by-step/`.
4. **Never** mark a step done without real artefacts on disk.

## The 15 steps (compulsory order)

| # | Step | You must produce |
|---|------|------------------|
| 1 | Ask — project | name, what to test, URL, screenshot |
| 2 | Ask — user stories | zip **or** Jira link **or** generate-from-system |
| 3 | Persist workspace | `User stories/`, `General/01-target.md` |
| 4 | Round 1 crawl | visible browser; every screen+popup → `Screens/round one/screenshots/` |
| 5 | Round 1 plan | after **each** shot: reference MD + update `round one/plan/` |
| 6 | Round 2 crawl | same structure under `Screens/round two/` |
| 7 | Generated stories | **only** method 3 → `GeneratedUser stories/` |
| 8 | System map | `Screens/complete-system-map.md` — long, exhaustive |
| 9 | Human test cases | `testCase Human/` — full system, GUI+API, Jira format, high-end model |
| 10 | Jira upload test cases | every case uploaded or payload written |
| 11 | testc2ai | 1:1 YAML per human case |
| 12 | AutomatedScripts | 1:1 GUI + API scripts |
| 13 | Run suite | **visible** GUI browser; all scripts executed |
| 14 | Export issues | XLSX + CSV with proof (iPay Lite Testing style columns) |
| 15 | File bugs | Jira bug per failure: subject, preconditions, steps, expected, actual, proof |

## Crawl loop (Rounds 1 & 2)

After **every** screenshot:

1. Save PNG under the round's `screenshots/`
2. **Read** the image (high-end vision/reasoning)
3. Write `references/<n>.md` — **every** button, link, tab, field, dialog, destination
4. Update `plan/living-plan.md` and `plan/todo.md`
5. Click first unvisited control → repeat until no unvisited controls remain

Then Round 2 for misses. Then system map + tests.

## Visible browser (locked)

Separate real browser window on the user's device. `QAFUSIONX_HEADED=0` is rejected. No silent crawl. No headless GUI tests.

**UNBREAKABLE ONE-BROWSER SESSION:** open once; keep the same window for Round 1 → Round 2 → all stories → maker → checker → suite. Never close mid-flow. Never reopen a second browser for the next story. Logout/login happens inside the same window. Close only at end-of-flow.

## Sinhala

MCP use කරනකොට Ask mode. Step tick නැතුව ඊළඟ step එකට යන්න බෑ. හැම screen එකම capture + reference + plan. Round 2 දෙක. පස්සේ test cases, YAML, scripts, run, export, bugs. මේ flow එක lock කරලා.

Browser: එක window එකක් open කරලා digatama යන්න. Story/round අතරේ close කරන්න එපා.
